{"id":"b8fb0c5932791f94","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-hod.md","title":"HOD","display":"thm-hod — HOD","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hod","aliases":["58-thm-hod"],"display":"thm-hod — HOD","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hod"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hod</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hod — HOD"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28d48ac87f8f834a\" href=\"?note=28d48ac87f8f834a\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md\">../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> (集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOD}\">\\(\\operatorname{HOD}\\)</span> (hereditarily ordinal-definable inner class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28d48ac87f8f834a\" href=\"?note=28d48ac87f8f834a\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md\">../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic ZFC axiom scheme)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (class-truth notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hod}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{HOD}\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hod}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{HOD}\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>HOD is handled as a definable proper class rather than as a set comprehension; consequently its ZFC truth assertion is a metatheoretic scheme, not an application of the set-coded four-argument satisfaction predicate.</li>\n<li>HOD is a transitive inner model of ZFC and therefore satisfies the axiom of choice internally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"28d48ac87f8f834a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"28d48ac87f8f834a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{HOD}$ (hereditarily ordinal-definable inner class, see [[../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HOD}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hod}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{HOD}\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1028,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-hod.md|58-thm-hod]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["28d48ac87f8f834a"]}